    "About me": "Name, surname, being a student, where you live.",
    "In class": "Asking the teacher to repeat, to slow down, and saying you don't know.",
    "Numbers and money": "Counting numbers, the literary numbers for digits, and prices in 箍.",
    "Classifiers": "Number or this / that + classifier + noun: 个, 本, 隻, 碗, 杯, 擺.",
    "Night market food": "The night market, its stalls and its food.",
    "At the market": "The traditional market: vegetables, meat, eggs, fish and fruit, and haggling over price.",
    "Time and days": "Today, tomorrow, yesterday, parts of the day, the week and the clock.",
    "Places and directions": "In front, behind, above, below, left, right, and turning.",
    "Getting around": "MRT, trains, taxis, walking, getting on.",
    "Questions and particles": "Question words and the yes/no questions with 無, 未, 敢 and 是毋是.",
    "Describing and comparing": "Very, too, more, most; and actions in progress or done.",
    "Traps for English speakers": "No \"to be\" with adjectives, the four negatives, 會 and 袂, sound-alikes and false friends."
